        "original_id": "dea47538-054b-5044-9374-6862d997d318",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Didier Drogba, Habib Bamogo, Péguy Luyindula\n- Organizations: Olympique de Marseille, Chelsea, Phoenix Rising FC\n- Roles: Striker\n- Topics: 2004–05 Olympique de Marseille season, player transfers, team performance\n\nFacts:\n- Didier Drogba was born on 11 March 1978.\n- Didier Drogba is an Ivorian professional footballer who plays as a striker for Phoenix Rising FC.\n- In the 2004–05 Olympique de Marseille season, Olympique de Marseille sold striker Didier Drogba to Chelsea.\n- In the 2004–05 Olympique de Marseille season, Habib Bamogo and Péguy Luyindula replaced Didier Drogba but did not perform at a similar level.\n- In the 2004–05 Olympique de Marseille season, Olympique de Marseille experienced reduced goal-scoring.\n- In the 2004–05 Olympique de Marseille season, Olympique de Marseille scored two points fewer than in the previous season but finished two positions higher.",
